# Documentation maintenance

- Docs must reflect actual implemented behavior, not planned future work
- Keep updates lightweight; avoid heavy architecture or flow documentation until the repo has enough real implementation
- Do not create speculative docs (architecture.md, flows/, entities-enums.md, external-services.md, etc.) unless explicitly requested
- Update docs when behavior changes; skip doc updates for refactors that do not change behavior
- Specs under `specs/` describe experiments; update `tasks.md` checkboxes when tasks complete
